WEBVTT

1
00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:27.869
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Can I help you?

2
00:00:28.152 --> 00:00:29.734
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi, Carla.

3
00:00:30.106 --> 00:00:30.829
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Hey, Ben.

4
00:00:31.717 --> 00:00:32.567
What would you like?

5
00:00:33.603 --> 00:00:35.683
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can I have an espresso, please?

6
00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.109
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Single or double?

7
00:00:37.989 --> 00:00:38.594
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Double.

8
00:00:41.437 --> 00:00:43.293
And a brownie, please.

9
00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:48.206
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> OK.

10
00:00:50.629 --> 00:00:51.518
Anything else?

11
00:00:56.382 --> 00:00:59.684
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can I have a latte, please? With oat milk.

12
00:01:00.153 --> 00:01:02.067
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Regular or large?

13
00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:03.122
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Large.

14
00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:05.818
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> To have here or take away?

15
00:01:05.955 --> 00:01:07.147
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> To take away.

16
00:01:10.058 --> 00:01:10.605
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> OK.

17
00:01:11.757 --> 00:01:13.184
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> How much is that?

18
00:01:14.063 --> 00:01:17.950
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> That’s twelve pounds forty-five, please.

19
00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:21.428
Thank you.

20
00:01:22.073 --> 00:01:23.743
Do you want a receipt?

21
00:01:24.075 --> 00:01:25.042
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No. Thank you.